Z||000007||tomcat06085||10-29-2001||05:00 PM||||  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Philphine:<BR><B>unless you want a wierd wing idea or a stereo (you know. the important stuff   :p ) all i can do is wish you luck. so for what it's worth...<P>good luck.<P>hey just thought. you can use my sig. it's not really mine but it definitly fits. if it's a big enough sticker it might be good for a horse or two.<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Thanks guys...I'll be getting tires for autocross soon and need advice. I've heard brand names from Yokahama, BF Goodrich to Kuhmo and Hoosier solo2...anyone have experience with any or all. I'll be running stock wheels and camber, caster, toe-in/out thats recommended by manufacturer's and racing buddies.<P>------------------<P>  <IMG SRC="http://jrreeves.com/images/blckfire.jpg">  <BR>tomcat...Thanks for the help!<p>[This message has been edited by tomcat06085 (edited 10-29-2001).]||||reg||7
